    "text": "The new owner."
  },
  {
    "id": "l06",
    "text": "You'll recognise this."
  },
  {
    "id": "l07",
    "text": "Edie Marsh. You got nine years."
  },
  {
    "id": "l08",
    "text": "I got out in six. Good behaviour."
  },
  {
    "id": "l09",
    "text": "What do you want?"
  },
  {
    "id": "l10",
    "text": "Hello, Fern."
  }
